{
	"\"Go gently. The forest walks with you.\"": "DialogueStateData.dialogue_state_prompt_bbcode",
	"\"PLEASURE DOING BUSINESS! TELL YOUR FRIENDS!\"": "DialogueStateData.dialogue_state_prompt_bbcode",
	"\"WELCOME, VALUED TRAVELER.\" An old golem rattles its coin slot hopefully.": "DialogueStateData.dialogue_state_prompt_bbcode",
	"A cracked stone fountain sputters glowing teal water. Something glints at the bottom, between the sparks.": "DialogueStateData.dialogue_state_prompt_bbcode",
	"A crucible of bubbling teal brew swirls on its own. Whatever goes in comes out different.": "DialogueStateData.dialogue_state_prompt_bbcode",
	"A dapper bronze golem snaps its shear hands. \"A little off the top?\"": "DialogueStateData.dialogue_state_prompt_bbcode",
	"A golem with a prize wheel for a belly creaks to life. It gestures at the handle invitingly.": "DialogueStateData.dialogue_state_prompt_bbcode",
	"A half-dragon warrior born in the cliffside kingdom. With dragon-scale claws and wings of ember fire, she tears through the rampaging clockwork golems that overran the ancient forest.": "CharacterData.character_description",
	"A heap of warm ash glitters with coins. Something glows deep inside.": "DialogueStateData.dialogue_state_prompt_bbcode",
	"A little bronze golem sets down its enormous pack. \"FIRST CUSTOMER OF THE DAY! A FREE GIFT, NO RECEIPT.\"": "DialogueStateData.dialogue_state_prompt_bbcode",
	"A patched-up practice golem raises its wooden-sword arms. \"SPAR? REWARDS INCLUDED.\"": "DialogueStateData.dialogue_state_prompt_bbcode",
	"A pile of coins still glows from a fire nobody remembers. The embers cling to everything.": "DialogueStateData.dialogue_state_prompt_bbcode",
	"A rune stone hums on a mossy altar. Its carvings ask for a little of your blood.": "DialogueStateData.dialogue_state_prompt_bbcode",
	"A stag of soft teal light steps out of the mist. Its antlers are living branches. It waits for you to choose.": "DialogueStateData.dialogue_state_prompt_bbcode",
	"A steaming spring bubbles between mossy stones, beside an old whetstone bench.": "DialogueStateData.dialogue_state_prompt_bbcode",
